{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"2bf9b5a0-1990-4193-942a-e966ef867114","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented analytics event tracking:\n\n- Added import for the `Analytics` wrapper in `registration_screen.dart`.\n- Added state flags `_emailStarted` and `_phoneStarted` to track first interactions.\n- Captured `registration_email_started` when the email field is first edited.\n- Captured `registration_phone_started` when the phone field is first edited.\n- Captured `loan_amount_changed` with the selected amount whenever the loan amount slider changes.\n- Captured `terms_accepted` when the terms checkbox is toggled.\n- Captured `registration_continue_tapped` when the Continue button is pressed and navigation to offers occurs.\n- Captured `offers_scrolled` with the scroll offset in `offer_screen.dart`.\n\nAll changes are documented in **ANSWER.md**.\n","duration_seconds":251.077378,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":35491,"output_tokens":21211,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":647488,"total_tokens":56702}}}
